OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%,.** %-,(,%,. (,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AHuel ad banned for suggesting its
OL,4,Aproducts could replace all conventional
OL,5,Afood
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Advertising Standards Authority
OL,8,F(ASA) said that viewers could assume
OL,9,Ffrom the ad that replacing all
OL,10,Fconventional food with Huel was
OL,11,F"nutritionally appropriate" and was
OL,12,Fcompatible with elite physical
OL,13,Fperformance.
OL,15,FHuel said Matthews' anecdote was not "a
OL,16,Frecommendation or instruction" and the
OL,17,Fpurpose of the ad was to challenge the
OL,18,Fmisconception that Huel could replace
OL,19,Fevery meal".
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
